              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nooha ogu ayaimukiriize owa Burugaizooba, nukwo asingule hoona haagenda? Amuha kusingura amahanga narubatirra abakama? Abahayo nk'ecuucu hali ekitara kye, nkebisunga ebitwarwa omuyaga ha buta bwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.2"
